Untap target Vehicle you control. It gains flying until end of turn. Draw a card.

Ithaca, Patient Kingdom enters tapped. {T}: Add {W}.
//Adventure// Homeward Oath — {2}{W} — Sorcery — Adventure
Return target permanent card with mana value 2 or less from your graveyard to your hand.

Scheria, Harbor of Wonders enters tapped. {T}: Add {U}.
//Adventure// Phaeacian Passage — {2}{U} — Sorcery — Adventure
Draw two cards, then discard a card.

Hades, Hall of Shades enters tapped. {T}: Add {B}.
//Adventure// Question the Dead — {2}{B} — Sorcery — Adventure
Mill three cards, then return a creature card from your graveyard to your hand.

Aeaea, Isle of Circe enters tapped. {T}: Add {R}.
//Adventure// Open the Hall — {2}{R} — Sorcery — Adventure
Exile the top two cards of your library. You may play one of them until the end of your next turn.

